wers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4551, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 536702, "username": "Wu0911", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/Wu0911", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5eff141212f24e0db7828f43ae95ab19?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5eff141212f24e0db7828f43ae95ab19?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5eff141212f24e0db7828f43ae95ab19?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1615257701, "last_modified": 1615257701, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "iversong", "last_touched": 1794297326, "title": "北漂四年的河北小夫妻，想去南方城市看看，想听听大家的意见", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1255766", "created": 1794276626, "deleted": 0, "content": "如题，北漂四年的河北小夫妻，无孩，想去南方城市看看，想听听大家的想法。\r\n是否推荐去南方工作 or 定居\r\n如果推荐的话，大家都推荐哪些城市呢\r\n男生 4 年服务端开发经验，女生 4 年数据分析，均为普通本科，今年 26 周岁", "content_rendered": "<p>如题，北漂四年的河北小夫妻，无孩，想去南方城市看看，想听听大家的想法。\n是否推荐去南方工作 or 定居\n如果推荐的话，大家都推荐哪些城市呢\n男生 4 年服务端开发经验，女生 4 年数据分析，均为普通本科，今年 26 周岁</p>\n", "last_modified": 1794276626, "replies": 92, "id": 1255766}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "name": "programmer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 74347, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9826, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 281438, "username": "hahaFck", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/hahaFck", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3f76d95c8badee4798edbe90ca41c87a?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3f76d95c8badee4798edbe90ca41c87a?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3f76d95c8badee4798edbe90ca41c87a?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1515574076, "last_modified": 1770101953, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "alcohobby1st", "last_touched": 1794296640, "title": "公司不让用苹果手机设备了，有 苹果 pro 尺寸大小的手机推荐么", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1255727", "created": 1794273039, "deleted": 0, "content": "感觉 pro 尺寸大小正好，不喜欢 pro max 那样太大的手机。也不想买太贵的。求手机推荐。\r\n\r\n这个要求是真特么扯，公司还没停止优化裁员呢，真怕换完被优化了。钱白花了。", "content_rendered": "<p>感觉 pro 尺寸大小正好，不喜欢 pro max 那样太大的手机。也不想买太贵的。求手机推荐。</p>\n<p>这个要求是真特么扯，公司还没停止优化裁员呢，真怕换完被优化了。钱白花了。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1794273039, "replies": 82, "id": 1255727}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 242928, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4551, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 45118, "username": "Mayday9421", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/Mayday9421", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cd6a/3674/45118_mini.png?m=1793935351", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cd6a/3674/45118_normal.png?m=1793935351", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cd6a/3674/45118_large.png?m=1793935351", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cd6a/3674/45118_xlarge.png?m=1793935351", "created": 1378692442, "last_modified": 1793935351, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "nobody123", "last_touched": 1794297213, "title": "有没有三个月瘦 30 斤的办法", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1255768", "created": 1794276819, "deleted": 0, "content": "从现在开始，想在过年前减肥减掉 30 斤，惊艳那些亲戚们，也给自己涨个面\r\n有没有什么方法？平常工作时间朝九晚六，一坐就是一天。\r\n离我最近的健身房，三个月 500 元子，有必要办一个吗", "content_rendered": "<p>从现在开始，想在过年前减肥减掉 30 斤，惊艳那些亲戚们，也给自己涨个面\n有没有什么方法？平常工作时间朝九晚六，一坐就是一天。\n离我最近的健身房，三个月 500 元子，有必要办一个吗</p>\n", "last_modified": 1794276819, "replies": 82, "id": 1255768}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_large.png?m=1768280127", "name": "career", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_normal.png?m=1768280127", "title": "职场话题", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/career", "topics": 24789, "footer": "", "header": "这里，我们聊聊那些工作中遇到的开心和不开心的事。", "title_alternative": "Career", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_mini.png?m=1768280127", "stars": 3766, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 770, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 338901, "username": "GB", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/GB", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c753f9ea9dbc762b0c6c7fed48954471?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c753f9ea9dbc762b0c6c7fed48954471?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c753f9ea9dbc762b0c6c7fed48954471?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1533538704, "last_modified": 1759114249, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "Cruzz", "last_touched": 1792917473, "title": "外企外包也许是大龄失业人员的最好归宿", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1255797", "created": 1794279072, "deleted": 0, "content": "入职一家外企外包几个月，谈谈感受。\r\n\r\n我们组一共 12 人，全部 95 前，还有几个 80 后，只有 3 个是正式的，其余全是外包。时间最长的在这边干了有 6 年多，稳定性不错\r\n\r\n工作极度轻松，是我工作以来最轻松的，之前在互联网公司上班的肯定不太适应这个节奏。以前公司排期一周的任务这边至少排一个月，做不完继续延期。有几位负责做重构的同事，他们的任务已经排到 2028 年了\r\n\r\n不打卡不管考勤，基本就是想来就来想走就走，我们一般 10 点到 6 点，午休两小时。不想来的随时可以居家办公，没人管。我们组有不少家在外地的，长期居家办公，我到现在还没见过真人。非常适合大龄有家庭有孩子的\r\n\r\n收入肯定比不了大厂，和一般民企差不多，10 年经验年收入税前 40-50w 左右，到手也就 30 多，但是胜在轻松，这个性价比还是可以的\r\n\r\n福利待遇不如正式员工，没有那么多的年假，但是随时请假，随时申请 wfh ，看起来差别不大。\r\n\r\n外企/外企外包不卡学历不卡年龄，只要懂一点点英语就行，真的对大龄非常友好了，强烈推荐失业的 v 友冲", "content_rendered": "入职一家外企外包几个月，谈谈感受。<br /><br />我们组一共 12 人，全部 95 前，还有几个 80 后，只有 3 个是正式的，其余全是外包。时间最长的在这边干了有 6 年多，稳定性不错<br /><br />工作极度轻松，是我工作以来最轻松的，之前在互联网公司上班的肯定不太适应这个节奏。以前公司排期一周的任务这边至少排一个月，做不完继续延期。有几位负责做重构的同事，他们的任务已经排到 2028 年了<br /><br />不打卡不管考勤，基本就是想来就来想走就走，我们一般 10 点到 6 点，午休两小时。不想来的随时可以居家办公，没人管。我们组有不少家在外地的，长期居家办公，我到现在还没见过真人。非常适合大龄有家庭有孩子的<br /><br />收入肯定比不了大厂，和一般民企差不多，10 年经验年收入税前 40-50w 左右，到手也就 30 多，但是胜在轻松，这个性价比还是可以的<br /><br />福利待遇不如正式员工，没有那么多的年假，但是随时请假，随时申请 wfh ，看起来差别不大。<br /><br />外企/外企外包不卡学历不卡年龄，只要懂一点点英语就行，真的对大龄非常友好了，强烈推荐失业的 v 友冲", "last_modified": 1794279072, "replies": 66, "id": 1255797}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 12065, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2548, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 578566, "username": "chenzhe", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/chenzhe", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/df65/0e7a/578566_mini.png?m=1790109585", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/df65/0e7a/578566_normal.png?m=1790109585", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/df65/0e7a/578566_large.png?m=1790109585", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/df65/0e7a/578566_xlarge.png?m=1790109585", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/df65/0e7a/578566_xxlarge.png?m=1790109585", "created": 1650260625, "last_modified": 1790109585, "pro": 1794297398}, "last_reply_by": "ysycoin", "last_touched": 1794297301, "title": "转眼， 33 了", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1255699", "created": 1794240966, "deleted": 0, "content": "转眼 33 岁了，一直觉得自己没长大，却已经是中登了。\r\n\r\n前两年遇到些事情，都抑郁了，好在去年熬过来了，可能也是正好装修房子把我的很大一部分精力都占据的缘故吧。\r\n\r\n今年本来觉得各方面都好起来了，结果上个月工作上的事情又很不顺心，导致现在赋闲在家吃软饭了。\r\n\r\n希望，前往 34 岁的人生旅途能顺吧。\r\n\r\n祝自己生日快乐。", "content_rendered": "<p>转眼 33 岁了，一直觉得自己没长大，却已经是中登了。</p>\n<p>前两年遇到些事情，都抑郁了，好在去年熬过来了，可能也是正好装修房子把我的很大一部分精力都占据的缘故吧。</p>\n<p>今年本来觉得各方面都好起来了，结果上个月工作上的事情又很不顺心，导致现在赋闲在家吃软饭了。</p>\n<p>希望，前往 34 岁的人生旅途能顺吧。</p>\n<p>祝自己生日快乐。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1794269771, "replies": 60, "id": 1255699}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/1fc2/1400/864_large.png?m=1778522847", "name": "promotions", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/1fc2/1400/864_normal.png?m=1778522847", "title": "推广", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/promotions", "topics": 15197, "footer": "", "header": "来自厂商的推广活动类主题，会被归类到这个节点。希望有情怀的产商们在发布推广内容时，主动选择发布到本节点下。点击 <a href=\"/help/node\">这里</a> 阅读 V2EX 的节点使用指南。", "title_alternative": "Promotions", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/1fc2/1400/864_mini.png?m=1778522847", "stars": 1529, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 864, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 433697, "username": "WinterLord", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/WinterLord", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/915f/d892/433697_mini.png?m=1780557126", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/915f/d892/433697_normal.png?m=1780557126", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/915f/d892/433697_large.png?m=1780557126", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/915f/d892/433697_xlarge.png?m=1780557126", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/915f/d892/433697_xxlarge.png?m=1780557126", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/915f/d892/433697_xxxlarge.png?m=1780557126", "created": 1564816168, "last_modified": 1780557126, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "magicflower", "last_touched": 1794296780, "title": "[HyperAPI 中转站]新老用户们来领鸡蛋了，评论留 ID，送$10 体验额度", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1255755", "created": 1794275497, "deleted": 0, "content": "站点： https://hyperapi.cc\r\n\r\nQQ 交流群：1095326876", "content_rendered": "<p>站点： <a href=\"https://hyperapi.cc\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://hyperapi.cc</a></p>\n<p>QQ 交流群：1095326876</p>\n", "last_modified": 1794275497, "replies": 56, "id": 1255755}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 242928, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4551, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 55329, "username": "br9852000", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/br9852000", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/51b4/58b4/55329_mini.png?m=1406595285", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/51b4/58b4/55329_normal.png?m=1406595285", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/51b4/58b4/55329_large.png?m=1406595285", "created": 1391607359, "last_modified": 1406595285, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "layxy", "last_touched": 1793582408, "title": "我是不是真的老年痴呆了？还是说被骗了？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1255737", "created": 1794273608, "deleted": 0, "content": "年纪大了，想喷点香水遮老人味，朋友推荐了大卫杜夫冷水，说是一百多左右。\r\n按自己的购物习惯，打开京东，搜索，选自营的挑个价格可以 99 的下单。\r\n然后给我寄来了个 1.2ml 小样，我以为寄错了，\r\n查了一下订单发现我买的就是小样。\r\n此时我怀疑自己是不是有老年痴呆。\r\n我咋就买错了呢，\r\n花了 95 买了个 1.2ml 的小样。200ml 的也只要 150 元左右。\r\nhttps://i.imgur.com/NEsUqtL.jpeg\r\nhttps://i.imgur.com/rTcCyyQ.jpeg\r\n\r\n好像也退不了，现在能理解年纪大的人容易被诈骗了。真的是脑子跟不上了。记录一下防止以后忘记了", "content_rendered": "年纪大了，想喷点香水遮老人味，朋友推荐了大卫杜夫冷水，说是一百多左右。<br />按自己的购物习惯，打开京东，搜索，选自营的挑个价格可以 99 的下单。<br />然后给我寄来了个 1.2ml 小样，我以为寄错了，<br />查了一下订单发现我买的就是小样。<br />此时我怀疑自己是不是有老年痴呆。<br />我咋就买错了呢，<br />花了 95 买了个 1.2ml 的小样。200ml 的也只要 150 元左右。<br /><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/NEsUqtL.jpeg\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NEsUqtL.jpeg\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br /><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/rTcCyyQ.jpeg\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rTcCyyQ.jpeg\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br /><br />好像也退不了，现在能理解年纪大的人容易被诈骗了。真的是脑子跟不上了。记录一下防止以后忘记了", "last_modified": 1794273608, "replies": 50, "id": 1255737}]